The '''Spirit & Soul Bundle''' is a [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] introduced in the game on the 16th October, 2024 by [[Nikilis]] for the [[Halloween Event 2024]]. It was purchaseable for 3,399 Robux, and contained the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] weapons [[Spirit]] and [[Soul]] along with a special effect [[Wraith (Effect)|Wraith]]. It is only obtainable through trading for it due to the [[Halloween Event 2024]] ending.

== Description ==
<nowiki>=== Available for a LIMITED TIME! ===</nowiki>

+ Exclusive "Wraith" EFFECT! + Exclusive "Spirit" GODLY knife! 

+ Exclusive "Soul" GODLY gun!

[ WARNING: Do not delete the game-pass. You can purchase a second copy of the knife in the in-game shop.]

