==Trivia==

*It is the tenth bundle to have two standalone gamepasses of the same weapons, the others being the [[Pearls Bundle]], [[Flowerwood Bundle]], [[Darkness Bundle]], [[Ocean Bundle]], [[Rainbow Bundle]], [[Sakura Bundle]], [[Ghost Bundle]], [[Plasma Bundle]] and [[Ice Bundle]].
**It is the [[Spirit Gamepass]] and the [[Soul Gamepass]]
*The link to the gamepass can be found [https://www.roblox.com/game-pass/942030669/BUNDLE-Spirit-Soul here].
